	(text_box "Q1: drain to the connector, source to the load; the 12 V zener keeps |Vgs| inside ±20 V.\nSMCJ33A: 33 V stand-off, ≤ 53 V clamp — below the TPS26600's 60 V rating.\nJ1 is a JST VH (10 A per contact): the hub input carries the whole rack, ≤ 7.3 A at 24 V."
